  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "半導體產業面面觀、經驗分享與實際演練",
    "sub_ename": "SEMICONDUCTOR INDUSTRY EXPERIENCES SHARING",
    "describe_ch": "預先建立學生進入半導體產業前的基礎認知與思維。在本課程當中，將介紹半導體產業全局觀、半導體產業的人才觀、半導體產業的創新和研發、半導體產業的商業思維和客戶觀、半導體產業的管理。",
    "describe_eh": "Establish students' basic knowledge and thinking before entering the semiconductor industry.This course will introduce the global view of the semiconductor industry, the talent outlook of the semiconductor industry, the innovation and R&D in the semiconductor industry, the business thinking and customer perspectives in the semiconductor industry, and the management of the semiconductor industry.",
